// Sofia, his uncle Viktor, his wife Kadri, the children Mia and Oskar, the dog Muki, his mother Helgi in Tartu. Goal,
// said on the first sheet: at the end the learner plans a surprise for Helgi's 60th birthday (009 Kasuta).
//   006 who is who on Sofia's photo — genitive of relations (minu ema vend); a family reunion.
//   007 new colleagues — kes-clauses (inimene, kes… / kellel… / keda…), looks and character; a lost child at the
//       shopping centre; choosing a babysitter.
//   008 after the picnic — kelle oma?, oma / tema, mis-clauses for things (kott, mille ma kaotasin); the lost and found.
//   009 time together — proposals and reasons; agreeing on a weekend; the birthday surprise.
// B1 grammar added here (METHODOLOGY_STANDARD §7): kes/mis relative clauses (007, 008). Lesson 5 is the module's mini
// Harno A2 exam (unchanged). The v3 file is in archive/v3/b1/module02.js, the v1 file in archive/v1/b1/module02.js.
